    "title": "Soften a brief action",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-brief-actions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Soften a brief action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "An eligible verb can repeat, as in 看看 or 想一想, to make an action brief or tentative. Verb + 一下 can also lighten a request or attempt; here 下 is not downward direction. Choose a suitable verb and situation rather than repeating every verb mechanically.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "问一下就明白了。",
                "pinyin": "wèn yīxià jiù míngbai le 。",
                "meaning": "A quick question will make it clear.",
                "audio": "f357a5ea2c4865c6ed5f314419647e6d835db1f30e3f3ae549110b810d4a7b30"
              },
              {
                "text": "看看你的书包。",
                "pinyin": "kàn kàn nǐ de shūbāo 。",
                "meaning": "Have a quick look at your schoolbag.",
                "audio": "c0aec4f619a0f5145765cbaab74ce2947271e9bba0d0f015a41586dfd3a08b34"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想一想。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng yī xiǎng 。",
                "meaning": "Let me think for a moment.",
                "audio": "c34fe9deb404410bbe82bfc68cfb531fc06977ad7a790d358f768ee183aac7ce"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
